    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create your own empire in the browser game Damoria</h2><br>This <strong>browser game</strong> will transport you back to a <strong>medieval world</strong> you'll want to stay in forever.<br><br><strong>Damoria</strong> is a mystical browser game fit for a king. Build <strong>your castle</strong> with all the trimmings: construction office, military training grounds and quarry.<br><br><strong>Mine raw materials</strong> and finance the construction of other buildings. Assemble <strong>your troops</strong> and arm them with swords, catapults, bows and arrows. You'll find everything your <strong>conqueror heart</strong> desires here.<br><br>Although it may seem like a peaceful paradise, a battle is raging at Damoria. Everyone's out to have the biggest castle and the largest kingdom.<br><br>Transform <strong>your castle</strong> into a stronghold, unconquerable to enemy attackers. Your fortress will protect you from all and sundry. Of course they do say that &quot;Offense is the best defense&quot;. Put together an army of epic proportions and <strong>conquer Damoria</strong>.",
